message: >-
  If you use paramaterial in your work, please cite the MSc thesis that describes it
  (preferred-citation below). To cite a specific version of the software, use the
  software entry.
title: paramaterial
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Slater
    given-names: Daniel
    email: danielgslater@gmail.com
abstract: >-
  Software toolkit for parameterising materials test data. Batch process experimental
  measurements to determine mechanical properties and material model parameters.
version: 0.2.0
license: MIT
repository-code: https://github.com/dan-slater/paramaterial
url: https://dan-slater.github.io/paramaterial/
keywords:
